# PR #15 — Trivy IaC scan false-positive allowlist.
# Cf. docs/EFE_A1_PHASE2_PR15_ARCHITECTURE.md § 20.
#
# Format : one finding ID per line.  Comment block above each entry
# documents (a) the finding, (b) why it's a false-positive or accepted
# risk, (c) who signed-off, (d) review date.
#
# Renovate-tracked : every line MUST be reviewed at the next quarterly
# SRE+sec audit.  Entries older than 6 months without a review date
# update are auto-removed by `make trivyignore-prune`.

