# ─── KSV014 — Root filesystem write access ──────────────────────────
# We DELIBERATELY set readOnlyRootFilesystem: true (PR #13 AD8).  Trivy
# sometimes flags helm-hooks Jobs that mount emptyDir at /tmp as
# "potentially writable" — but emptyDir-Memory at /tmp is the SUPPORTED
# pattern (see PR #14 audit pass C1).  Polaris is happy ; Trivy is
# noisy.  This is a known Trivy quirk for emptyDir-Memory mounts.
# Reviewer : sre
# Last review : 2026-05-14
# Re-review by : 2026-11-14
